│ the core issue is that Django’s schema       │
│ backend isn't correctly handling the removal │
│ of a composed index when the index itself is │
│ deleted, particularly when unique_together   │
│ constraints are present. The error arises    │
│ because the backend attempts to reconcile    │
│ the constraints with the index structure,    │
│ leading to the ValueError.                   │
│                                              │
│ The solution is to simplify the index        │
│ deletion logic within delete_composed_index  │
│ to avoid attempting to reconcile constraints │
